<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Innovex Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Innovex Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said it upgraded Innovex Inc to &quot;portfolio buy&quot; from &quot;buy on weakness.&quot;</p>
<p>-- raised its second quarter earnings estimates to $0.41 a share from $0.28 a share and the full year 1997 earnings estimate to $1.70 a share from $1.26 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the price target to $43 a share from $39 a share.</p>
<p>-- addition details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Innovex lost 1-5/8 to 25.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
